### ==============================================================================
### Payload CMS - Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) REST Client Suite
### OWASP Top 10:2025 Hardened: A01 Broken Access Control & A07 Auth Management
### CWE-798: No Hard-coded Credentials | CWE-359: Sensitive PII Protection
### ==============================================================================
### USAGE:
### - This template is safe to commit to version control (GitHub).
### - In VS Code REST Client, variables are read from your local .env file.
### - To execute locally, ensure .env is populated (see env.simple).
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9092
@password = {{$dotenv RBAC_TEST_PASSWORD}}
@adminEmail = {{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@adminPassword = {{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@adminNewPassword = {{$dotenv ADMIN_NEW_PASSWORD}}
@hrEmail = {{$dotenv HR_USER_EMAIL}}
@managerEmail = {{$dotenv MANAGER_USER_EMAIL}}
@employeeEmail = {{$dotenv EMPLOYEE_USER_EMAIL}}
@attackerEmail = {{$dotenv ATTACKER_USER_EMAIL}}
@demoEmail = {{$dotenv DEMO_EMAIL}}
@demoPassword = {{$dotenv DEMO_PASSWORD}}
@demoNewPassword = {{$dotenv DEMO_NEW_PASSWORD}}
@testCardId = {{$dotenv TEST_EMPLOYEE_CARD_ID}}
@testSalary = {{$dotenv TEST_EMPLOYEE_SALARY}}

### ==============================================================================
### 0. SYSTEM BOOTSTRAP & AUTHENTICATION LIFECYCLE
### ==============================================================================

### 0.1 First Admin Signup (Bootstrap ONLY - works while admins collection is empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admins/first-register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}",
  "firstname": "Security",
  "lastname": "Admin"
}

### 0.2 Admin Forgot Password Request
# @name adminForgot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admins/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}"
}

### 0.3 Admin Reset Password (Provide token from DB admins.reset_password_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admins/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_RESET_TOKEN_HERE",
  "password": "{{adminNewPassword}}"
}


### ==============================================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & LOGIN FOR RBAC ROLES
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Superadmin Login (Admins Collection)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admins/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 1.2 HR Specialist Login (Role: 'hr')
# @name hrLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{hrEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 1.3 Department Manager Login (Role: 'manager')
# @name managerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 1.4 Regular Employee Login (Role: 'employee')
# @name employeeLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{employeeEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### ==============================================================================
### 2. PRIVILEGE ESCALATION DEFENSE (OWASP A01 TEST)
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Public Register Attack: Attempt to self-assign "role": "admin"
# Expected: 201 Created, but returned 'role' MUST be forced to 'employee' (Defense in Depth)
# @name attackRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{attackerEmail}}",
  "username": "attacker",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2.2 Verify Attacker Profile (Check that role is 'employee', NOT 'admin')
# @name attackerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{attackerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2.3 Inspect Attacker Token & Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{attackerLogin.response.body.$.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 3. ROLE: HR SPECIALIST (Full Employee CRUD & Salary Visibility)
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 HR: List All Employees (Should see all records + decrypted salaries)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 3.2 HR: Create New Employee (Allowed for HR)
# @name hrCreateEmployee
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Nattapong CyberGuard",
  "email": "nattapong.c@cybersec.local",
  "mobile": "0891112233",
  "cardId": "{{testCardId}}",
  "department": 1,
  "position": 2,
  "salary": {{testSalary}}
}

### 3.3 HR: Update Employee Salary (Allowed for HR)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{hrCreateEmployee.response.body.$.doc.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "salary": 80000
}

### 3.4 HR: Attempt to Delete Employee (Forbidden: 403 - Only Superadmin can delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{hrCreateEmployee.response.body.$.doc.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.$.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 4. ROLE: DEPARTMENT MANAGER (Scoped Access, Sensitive PII Hidden)
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1 Manager: List Employees (Should see employees, but 'salary' & 'cardId' are stripped)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 4.2 Manager: Attempt to Create Employee (Forbidden: 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Unauthorized Add",
  "email": "unauth@cybersec.local",
  "department": 1,
  "position": 1
}

### 4.3 Manager: Update Employee Mobile in Own Department (Allowed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "mobile": "0819998877"
}

### 4.4 Manager: Attempt to Tamper with Salary (Forbidden / Stripped by Field Access)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "salary": 999999
}


### ==============================================================================
### 5. ROLE: REGULAR EMPLOYEE (Self-Service View, Directory Browsing)
### ==============================================================================

### 5.1 Employee: Browse Public Company Directory (Allowed, salaries hidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 5.2 Employee: View Own Record (Matching email)
# Allowed to see their OWN salary and cardId!
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?where[email][equals]={{employeeEmail}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 5.3 Employee: Attempt to Create Employee (Forbidden: 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Fake Employee"
}

### 5.4 Employee: Attempt to Delete Record (Forbidden: 403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeLogin.response.body.$.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 6. ROLE: SUPERADMIN (Admins Collection or 'admin' Role)
### ==============================================================================

### 6.1 Admin: List All Users & Assigned Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 6.2 Admin: Elevate User Role (Only Admin can modify 'role' field)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "role": "hr"
}

### 6.3 Admin: Delete Employee Record (Allowed for Superadmin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/{{hrCreateEmployee.response.body.$.doc.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.token}}


### ==============================================================================
### 7. AUXILIARY COLLECTIONS (Departments & Positions & Media)
### ==============================================================================

### 7.1 Read Departments (All Authenticated Users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 7.2 Create Department (Forbidden for Employee, Allowed only for Superadmin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Illegal Department"
}

### 7.3 HR: Create Job Position (Allowed for HR & Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/positions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "DevSecOps Specialist",
  "level": "senior",
  "description": "Security in CI/CD pipeline automation"
}
